  "notable_quotes": [
    "In 2, tar dianions bridge adjacent Zn-trz layers by chelating through hydroxyl and carboxylate groups in a μ2, κ4 mode, creating the 3D framework.",
    "Compound 1 forms a 2D layered network based on {[Zn4(trz)4]4+}n sheets decorated by succinate, topologically described as a (4, 8^2) net.",
